---
/**
 * Starlight override: no theme picker.
 *
 * The site is dark everywhere, so the control is removed rather than left
 * rendering a choice that does nothing. Starlight renders this component twice
 * — desktop header and mobile menu — and both disappear with it.
 *
 * Rendering nothing also takes Starlight's `ThemeSelect` client script out of
 * the build: it is the module that defines the `starlight-theme-select` custom
 * element, reads and writes `localStorage['starlight-theme']`, and subscribes
 * to `prefers-color-scheme` changes. None of that has anything left to do.
 */
---
